      "writtenOn": "2023-02-01T22:59:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After doing some additional digging, it turns out that `-d` doesn\u0027t do what I thought it did (and I am not using it properly). Adding it where I have been in this CL causes nsjail to fail on startup, which disables sandboxing entirely (and emits a log statement I missed)\n\nThus, my tests have been running with sandboxing disabled.\n\nI\u0027ll follow up to see if we can devise a solution with nsjail, otherwise it might be a bit back to the drawing board (or potentially proposing we disable sandboxing entirely for soong_build)",
      "parentUuid": "3f444286_afeace99",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 14,
        "startChar": 45,
        "endLine": 15,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "24446fc81755108748a7d75928b126f566060ee5",
