      "writtenOn": "2023-02-01T23:18:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, yeah. You\u0027d need to do it in `wrapSandbox` instead of `sandboxSupported`, but I\u0027m pretty sure `-d` is also going to be a problem. `-d` goes into daemon mode immediately, so I don\u0027t think we would wait for soong_build to finish. A better approach may be to disable the pid namespace, as IIRC, that\u0027s what forces all background processes to exit. It looks like that\u0027s `--disable_clone_newpid`, though I don\u0027t know if it has any other implications.",
      "parentUuid": "ff29ef08_4c78289d",
